Feature: Task manager
  As a user,
  I want to add multiple tasks to my todo list at once,
  So that I can organize what I need to do efficiently.

  Acceptance Criteria:
  1. User should start with an empty todo list.
  2. User can add multiple tasks in one action.
  3. All added tasks should be visible in the list.
  4. The final task count should reflect all added tasks.